  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "かたい　からを　もつ　おおきな　タネを\nうえから　たたきつけて\nあいてを　こうげきする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단단한 껍질을 가지고 있는\n큰 씨앗을 위에서 힘껏 내던져\n상대를 공격한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從上方砸下外殼堅硬的\n大種子，攻擊對手。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur fait pleuvoir un déluge de graines explosives\nsur l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender lässt eine Menge Samen mit harter Schale\nvon oben auf das Ziel fallen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza al objetivo una descarga de semillas explosivas\ndesde arriba.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa emette una raffica di semi dal guscio\nduro che colpiscono il bersaglio dall’alto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user slams a barrage of hard-shelled seeds\ndown on the target from above.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "硬い　殻を　もつ　大きな　タネを\n上から　たたきつけて\n相手を　攻撃する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将外壳坚硬的大种子，\n从上方砸下攻击对手。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
